Witch & Ward — Rulebook and Foundry VTT System
Copyright (c) 2026 Richard Moore. All rights reserved.

This repository contains two kinds of material:

1. SOFTWARE — the Foundry VTT system code and tooling (everything under
   module/, styles/, templates/, lang/, tools/, sim/, test/, book/build.mjs,
   book/tools/, and the manifest files).

2. GAME CONTENT — the text of the game "Witch & Ward" (the rulebook source
   under book/src/, its illustrations under book/art/, the built rulebook PDFs,
   and any compendium source data under packs/_source/ and the compiled packs/),
   including the rules, the setting, its characters, and all associated writing
   and art.

All rights are reserved by the copyright holder. No part of this repository may
be reproduced, distributed, sold, or sublicensed without the express written
permission of the copyright holder.

NOTE FOR THE AUTHOR: this is a conservative default suited to a commercial
release (e.g. on DriveThru RPG). If you wish to open-source the software while
keeping the game content proprietary, replace this file with your chosen
software license (for example the MIT License) and add an explicit statement
that the GAME CONTENT above remains © the author and is excluded from that
license. The typefaces embedded in the built PDFs are licensed separately under
the SIL Open Font License 1.1.

